},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Former extreme gravure idol = \"Hitomi\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At the time, she was popular for her many racy photos, but at the age of 28, she retired from the industry without being noticed. Later, she married her current husband. She now teaches aerobics at a nearby culture school. She often practices it at home."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her husband is a director of the company he works for, but he became a guarantor for his friend (the president of the company), and the president ran away with the debt intact. Since then, she has been dealing with the collectors who visit their house. She has a son, Taiki, who is in elementary school. She is still unable to wean her son off the breast, so she lets him suckle her when he sleeps."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her waist and hips have grown since her days as a gravure idol and her bust is also slightly gravity-defying. She has a body that is not suitable for her age, and is very attractive to men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30570"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元過激グラビアアイドル＝ヒトミ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当時際どいカットが多くマイナー人気があったが、人知れず引退。その後はOLを経て結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は近所のカルチャースクールでエアロビの講師をしており、家でその練習をたびたび行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は勤める会社の役員だが、友人(社長)の保証人となり、友人が逃亡。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒトミに必ず金をなんとかすると言い残し夫も家を出たきり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"息子は私立の学校に通っているのでお金がかかり、息子のことを主人公にたてに取られると弱い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11502","sourceWorkId":"14139","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"登場作品：『熟母喰い』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢：38歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：基本的に専業主婦だが、美容と健康維持のためカルチャースクールのエアロビ講師の仕事をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"血液型 ：A型"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：165cm"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スリーサイズ：B88（Fカップ）/W60/H89"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：エアロビ"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11502","sourceWorkId":"16311","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グラドル時代、際どいカットが多くマイナー人気があったが、28歳のとき人知れず引退。その後、現在の夫と結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は、近所のカルチャースクールでエアロビの講師をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は勤める会社の役員だが、友人（社長）の保証人となり、社長は借金をそのままに逃亡、夫は瞳に必ず金をなんとかすると言い残し家を出たきり。以来、家に訪れる取り立て屋の相手は彼女がすることとなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"グラドル時代は過激なポーズをとるなどしていたが、本当の性格は地味で謙虚な性格。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93184"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b19effaa496de59f829ff6ab37c5695fb437ce1d0350ee181a47da26c76a6dc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9dd7903c910df293615c0bad46caf833e0eaa945a17e99b2f7391f5c56ec04c1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"如月美琴","creatorId":"vndb:s1012","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1012","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1012","name":"如月 美琴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:218985:93184:6217:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c30571","characterName":"長峰 ルミ子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93185","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"218985"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11503"],"vndbCharacterId":"c30571"},"originalCharacterName":"長峰 ルミ子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"41"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"100"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A petit-celebrity housewife who lives diagonally across the street from the Kurita family. She has been a full-time housewife since her marriage. She has a daughter and a son who are no longer in need of her help."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has always been proud and concerned about appearances since she was young. She married her husband because he was an elite man working for a prestigious company. She has not had sex for many years. Her husband who is now the general manager of the prestigious company is having an affair with a subordinate. Rumiko is aware and is afraid of getting a divorce."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is afraid that getting a divorce will lower her current standard of living, so even though she aware of his infidelity she puts up with it. She is a mother who does not get along well with her children, who feel alienated from her because she only cares about her physical appearance and status."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She enjoys browsing the internet. She browses through friendship forums to to release her pent-up sexual desires, she refuses to register on dating sites because her pride would not allow her to do so, nor would she dare to."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is sex-starved and lives in agony. As she watches the protagonist visit the Kurita household daily, she tries her luck and tries to quench her pent up desires with him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30571"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"プチセレブな専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、高校生の娘と中学生の息子がいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若い頃から体制や見栄えなどを気にするタチで、夫も一流企業に勤めるエリートということで結婚した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"インターネットが趣味で溜まりに溜まった性欲を開放しようとセフレ掲示板などを見るが、彼女のプライドが許さず大人の玩具を通販で買い、ひっそりと、激しく自慰に耽っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11503","sourceWorkId":"14139","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若い頃からプライドが高く、体裁や見栄えなどを気にするタチで夫とは一流企業に勤めるエリートということで結婚した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もう何年も性生活のない夫は、現在一流企業の部長だが、部下（若い女）と浮気。そのことをルミ子は知っているが、離婚されるのが怖い、今の生活レベルを落としたくないため、わかっていてもそれを咎めることも出来ず、日夜悶々とした日々を送っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93185"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd709ce0690844451be93a51a073175e0608ca66f5f1d289e48368b0d70f0be6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/299d2b29381168fc7b2be7980774a74e6564e16f256f09c2a057bf3864c01584.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あらいしずか","creatorId":"vndb:s665","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s665","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s665","name":"あらい しずか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:218985:93185:4647:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c47829","characterName":"南 士朗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c47829"},"originalCharacterName":"南 士朗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He graduated from university in economics. However, he was unable to find a job due to the difficult employment situation. He joined Hokuyo Finance, a black-money firm that was looking for a part-timers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His personality suited the job of a collection agency, and he felt at home there. At first glance, he looks like a nervous young man, but as a collection agent he is as persistent and cunning as a snake. He has always loved to take advantage of his opponents and make them dance in the palm of his hand, he particularly gets pleasure from corrupting women."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When collecting money, he does don't try to violently corrupt clients but rather to exploit their weakness and corrupt them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He behaves in an economic yakuza-like manner. Depending on the situation, he may be violent but it will be calculated."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When he was a student, there was a popular gravure idol he was a fan of. Hitomi was the object of his desires and frequently used her as masturbation material. As he went to go collect debt, he discovers that Hitomi is the wife of the man who owes money. He decides to corrupt her while keeping a careful eye on her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c47829"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:1708","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1708","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:1708","name":"Guilty+","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-brand:8489:1708","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2705","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2705","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2705","name":"Guilty+","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:11205:v3358","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p187","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p187","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p187","name":"アイチェリー","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:170573:v3358","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2705","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2705","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2705","n